# Literature Expansion Report: Direction 04 — Lineage & Accessory Genome

**Direction:** Thermoplasmatota dark proteomes, archaeal genetic codes, reference bias, MAG versus cultivated strain accessory genome comparisons, and completeness confounding.  
**Target Manuscript:** P4 Dark-Proteome Manuscript ([`manuscript/main.tex`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/manuscript/main.tex), [`manuscript/references.bib`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/manuscript/references.bib), [`notes/dossiers/07_lineage_darkness_archaea.md`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/notes/dossiers/07_lineage_darkness_archaea.md), [`notes/dossiers/04_reference_gap.md`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/notes/dossiers/04_reference_gap.md)).  
**Deliverables:**
- **TSV Manifest:** [`manifest.tsv`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/resources/literature/darkmatter-2026-10-13/papers/04_lineage_accessory/manifest.tsv)
